{"name": "Mystery Box 2: Evolution", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras_big/a1d0d1c90c27d96445b36b413030bffd.avif?t=1785490097\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/a1d0d1c90c27d96445b36b413030bffd.avif?t=1785490097\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn wheels, move handles, push buttons, and think smart to solve the puzzles, unlock all the boxes, and collect tiles to discover lost artifacts. You can find hidden tiles on the side of the boxes as well, so pay attention to the details!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras_big/8d7e5da3c0fbf8e66bf06bccd9197e44.avif?t=1785490097\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/8d7e5da3c0fbf8e66bf06bccd9197e44.avif?t=1785490097\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover all Artifacts in this escape room game to unlock an extra amazing level, the Ghost Box!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras_big/e5366ddb74f42747ecceb72ceacacd67.avif?t=1785490097\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/e5366ddb74f42747ecceb72ceacacd67.avif?t=1785490097\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think outside of the box to solve all the puzzles, it's not always easy, but I know you can escape the rooms!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras_big/340020d03f99350dec9973ced7a26c03.avif?t=1785490097\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/340020d03f99350dec9973ced7a26c03.avif?t=1785490097\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you open all 8 boxes of a chosen pack (and you also collected the small hidden puzzle tiles on the side of the boxes), you'll be able to compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras_big/97b64500759a249c816c3e7302dcc24b.avif?t=1785490097\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/97b64500759a249c816c3e7302dcc24b.avif?t=1785490097\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the game with your headphones on, and get totally immersed in the adventure! Each Box Pack has its music theme, so your escape room experience will be unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras_big/de6bd49678c302a2e0b5a9d02ecd1b29.avif?t=1785490097\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/de6bd49678c302a2e0b5a9d02ecd1b29.avif?t=1785490097\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In case you get stuck while trying to solve a riddle, click the bulb button to get a hint that will help you solve the puzzle you're blocked to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras_big/169a7bd284520d53612f1f10a745f3f9.avif?t=1785490097\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/169a7bd284520d53612f1f10a745f3f9.avif?t=1785490097\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you complete all the achievements of this game? Every time you complete a Box Pack, you'll earn its special <strong><i>Steam Achievement</i></strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to show your results to the community and spread the word with your friends, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">they may want to compete with you ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785490097\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785490097\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Crack complex logic riddles in Mystery Box 2 \u2014 a 3D point-and-click escape room adventure. Inspect 57 detailed boxes, find hidden puzzle pieces, collect historical artifacts, and challenge your brain with atmospheric mechanical enigmas.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541380/2e0ce8b3986701887d55adaa1a5281b52f0b726b/header.jpg?t=1785490097", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Strategy", "Point & Click", "Puzzle", "Incremental", "Hidden Object"], "developers": "XSGames", "publishers": "XSGames", "rel